  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When in human form, you can take the likeness of another with remarkable accuracy.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Realistic Likeness<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain a bonus equal to your mythic tier on Disguise checks to fool others with your impersonation. If you expend one use of your mythic power, you can emulate the effects of misdirection with the impersonated human as your target, as long as the human is within 30 feet of you when you make the transformation. This effect lasts for one hour per mythic tier you possess.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc24\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
